   "text": "We're all doing the right thing, not because we have to, because we want to. I don't have a chance of getting out of prison as far as right now, because I'm a lifer. So I'm not doing this to make myself feel good for the governor, because he don't care what I look like. I'm doing it to help my fellow inmate, because this is my community.",
